{"title":"Tmux","markdown":{"yaml":{"description":"Tmux","output-file":"tmux.html","skip_exec":true,"skip_showdoc":true,"title":"Tmux"},"headingText":"Session","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n\n\n<!-- WARNING: THIS FILE WAS AUTOGENERATED! DO NOT EDIT! -->\n\n\n### Create a new session\n\n```sh\ntmux\n```\n```sh\ntmux new\n```\n```sh\ntmux new -s <session name>\n```\n\n### List Session\n\n```sh\ntmux ls\n```\n```sh\ntmux list-sessions\n```\n```sh\ntmux new -s <session name>\n```\n\n### Attach Session\n\n```sh\ntmux a\n```\n```sh\ntmux at\n```\n```sh\ntmux a -t <session name>\n```\n\n### Kill Session\n\n```sh\ntmux kill-session -t <session name>\n```\n\n### Rename session\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `$`\n\n### Detach from session\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `d`\n\n### Session and Window Preview\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `w`\n\n### Move to previous session\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `(`\n\n### Move to next session\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `)`\n\n## Windows\n\n### Create session with named window\n\n```sh\ntmux new -s mysession -n mywindow\n```\n\n### Create new window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `c`\n\n### Rename current window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `,`\n\n### Close current window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `&`\n\n### List window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `w`\n\n### Previous window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `p`\n\n### Next window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `n`\n\n### Switch to window by number\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `0...9`\n\n## Panes\n\n### Split window vertically\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `%`\n\n### Split window horizontally\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `\"`\n\n### Navigate panes\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `up, down, right, left`\n\n### Close current pane\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `x`\n\n### Move the current pane left\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `{`\n\n### Move the current pane right\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `}`\n\n### Switch to next pane\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `o`\n\n### Show pane numbers\n\n`Ctrl` + `b` `q` `0...9`\n\n### Convert pane to window\n\n`Ctrl` + `b`  `!`\n\n### Toggle pane zoom\n\n`Ctrl` + `b` `z`\n\n### Resize pane\n\n`Ctrl` + `b` + `up, down, right, left`\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n\n\n<!-- WARNING: THIS FILE WAS AU